@startuml
!theme plain
title Component Architecture — Multi-Agent RAG System

package "MCP Layer" {
  [Coordinator] as Coordinator
  [DataBroker] as DataBroker
}

package "Agents" {
  [Ingest Agent] as Ingest
  [RAG Agent] as RAG
  [Auto Agent] as Auto
  [Manual Agent] as Manual
}

package "UI & Orchestration" {
  [Web UI] as UI
  [Experiment Orchestrator] as Orchestrator
}

package "External Services" {
  [LLM Provider (Gemini / Vertex AI)] as LLM
  [Vector DB / FAISS] as VectorDB
  [Object Storage (S3/GCS)] as Storage
}

Coordinator -down-> DataBroker : coordinates
Ingest --> DataBroker : POST /store (file + metadata)
DataBroker --> Storage : optionally persist artifact
RAG --> DataBroker : GET /artifact/<id> /download
RAG --> VectorDB : store / query vectors
RAG --> LLM : summarize retrieved contents
UI --> Orchestrator : trigger experiments / jobs
Orchestrator --> Coordinator : POST /task
Auto --> Orchestrator : register / submit outputs
Manual --> Orchestrator : register / submit outputs

note right of DataBroker
- files saved to /tmp/<uuid>
- metadata in-memory (demo)
- fallback: check /tmp when metadata missing
end note

note left of RAG
Embeddings: sentence-transformers (preferred)
Fallback: TF-count vectors + NumPy search
end note

@enduml
